TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 732093835}
  m_Text: 'QUEST 2 / 3

    Grip to grab. Pull doors. Grip and turn knobs.

    Rest
    food on the board before cutting.

    Bring a meal to your mouth + trigger to
    eat.

    Either stick: forward teleport; sideways turn.


    PC PREVIEW

    WASD
    move  /  Hold right mouse to look

    Left click grab / release  /  E interact

    Scroll
    knob or held reach  /  F eat  /  C chop'
